{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792267080, "covers_from": "2026-10-17T19:58:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-17T19:59:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792267140, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-17T19:58:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 40657, "sprite_key": "bear_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "經濟", "content": "東區忠孝東路黃金地段的店面空置已久，有什麼方法讓房東跟房客有雙贏的方法(例如降低房租改為抽成）？", "display_name": "信義代表 No.40,657", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-17T19:58:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 56125, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "交通", "content": "路真的很不平，去過日本就會感嘆為什麼日本的路跟台灣差這麼多，動不動就挖起來填補時又隨便", "display_name": "信義代表 伸", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-17T19:58:29+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 55768, "sprite_key": "bear_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "其他", "content": "你好，我每次只要去北車搭高鐵，就覺得那邊遊民很多，如果你當市長是否有政策去解決遊民問題？", "display_name": "中正代表 No.55,768", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-17T19:58:43+00:00", "duration_seconds": 17, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 13785, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "環境", "content": "我住內湖明美公園旁，先前跟1999反映多次說公園有很多垃圾，但從來都沒有獲得改善，這1999功能不彰", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.13,785", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 56125, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "信義代表 伸", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 55768, "sprite_key": "bear_oldtown", "display_name": "中正代表 No.55,768", "district": "zhongzheng", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 13785, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.13,785", "district": "neihu", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 25381, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "disp